Here is a PlantUML code that represents a flowchart for traffic control according to the provided requirements:

```plantuml
@startuml

start
if (Are all car colors blue \n or green?) then (yes)
  :Check the next car;
  if (Next car is green?) then (yes)
    :Inform administration;
  else (no)
    :Continue checking cars;
  endif
  if (All cars checked?) then (yes)
    :End traffic control;
    stop
  else (no)
    -> if
  endif
else (no)
  :End traffic control;
  stop
endif

@enduml
```

The flowchart begins with the "start" node. It then checks if all car colors are either blue or green. If yes, it proceeds to check the next car. If the next car is green, it informs the administration. Otherwise, it continues checking cars. After checking all cars, the flowchart ends. If any car has a color other than blue or green, it directly ends the traffic control.
